menu "Host Diagnostics fail-closed validation"

comment "Select one fault. The ESP-BIST library is unchanged; the fault comes from this app."

config BIST_HD_TEST_KEY_MISMATCH
    bool "Build the host agent with a challenge key the companion does not share"
    default n
    help
      Compiles the HP-side library with BIST_HD_CHALLENGE_KEY set to a value
      other than CONFIG_ESP_BIST_HD_CHALLENGE_KEY, which the LP companion keeps.
      The production answer path then produces a wrong answer every round, so
      the companion must enter safe state.

config BIST_HD_TEST_STARVE_AGENT
    bool "Starve the Host Diagnostic Agent past the challenge window"
    default n
    help
      app_main() raises its own priority above the agent task and busy-waits,
      occupying every HP core, so no ANSWER reaches the companion before the
      challenge window expires.

endmenu
